              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.18.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 18:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.6.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 6:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako kanya umuntu avugishwa n’Imana arenguka imbere ya Ahabu umwami w’Abisirayeli, aramubarira, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo Mbega ntubona izo ngabo ukuntu ar’ isinzi? ng’ Uyu musi arazigabura mu maboko yawe, ngo Nawe uca umenya kw ar’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu aramubaza, ati Ni ba nde bagiye kubanesha? Na we aramwishura, at’ Uhoraho agize ngo N’imikangara y’abaganwa. Arongera aramubaza, at’ Ūja gusomboroza ni nde? Na we ati Ni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw akoranya iyo mikangara y’abaganwa, baba amajana abiri na mirongwitatu na babiri; hanyuma akoranya ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli, baba ibihumbi ndwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gihe c’amashōka barasokoroka bava mu gisagara ngo barwane. Kand’ ico gihe Beni‐hadadi yarikw aranywa, amaze kuborerwa, bo na ba bami bari batabaye, ukw ari mirongwitatu na babiri, bari mu nsago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mikangara y’abaganwa ni bo babanje gusokoroka; kandi Beni‐hadadi yar’ atumye abo kumurerekera, baraza baramubarira, bati Hasokorotse abantu bavuye i Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aravuga, ati Namba bazanywe no kwisaba, mubafate mpiri; na ho ni baba baje kurwana, na ho nyene mubafate mpiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ iyo mikangara y’abaganwa, bo na za ngabo zibakurikiye, basokorotse mu gisagara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "batangura gushirako, umuntu wese agira uwo yica; maz’ Abasiriya barahunga, Abisirayeli barabakinagiza; maze Beni‐hadadi asimbira kw ifarasi, hamwe n’abandi bayagenderako, arabakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami w’Abisirayeli na we asokoroka mu gisagara, atera abagendera ku mafarasi n’imikogote, atikiza Abasiriya agatikizo gakomeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
