          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma wa muvugishwa aza ku mwami w’Abisirayeli, ati Genda witegure, wiyumvire umenye uk’ uzogenza, kuko mu mwaka utaha ku gacikamvura, umwami w’i Siriya azokwongera kugutera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu b’umwami w’i Siriya baramubarira, bat’ Imana yabo n’imana ikara mu misozi miremire, ni co catumye batunesha; ariko none tuze turwanire na bo mu biyaya: ntituzobura kuba ari twebge tubanesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ugenze urtya: ukwiye gukūrah’ abo bami, bave mu myanya yabo, maze mu gishingo cabo ushireh’ abagabisha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uheze ukoranye izindi ngabo zingana n’izo wabuze; usubize ifarasi mu gishingo c’iyabuze, n’umukogote mu gishingo c’uwabuze nyene. Duheze tuze turwanire na bo mu kiyaya, maze ntituzobura kuba ari twebge tubanesha. Nukw arabemerera, abigenza artyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko wa mwaka utashe, ku gacikamvura Beni‐hadadi akoranya Abasiriya, aradūga aja i Afeka ngw atere Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abisirayeli barakorakorana, bahitana impamba zabo, baragenda baratabara, baca insago ahahanganye na bo, bameze nk’udukuku tubiri tw’ impene, arikw Abasiriya bo bari bājimagije igihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze haza umuntu w’Imana, abarira umwami w’Abisirayeli, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngw Abasiriya ko bavuze ng’ Uhoraho n’imana ikara mu misozi miremire, ngw Ariko s’imana ikara mu biyaya; ngo none rero, aya masinzi y’ingabo agiye kuyagabura mu maboko yawe, ngo Namwe muzomenya kw ari we Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bamara imisi ndwi bashagaje ngaho bahanganye. Maze ku musi ugira indwi bararumana. Abisirayeli bica mu Basiriya ingabo ibihumbi ijana ku musi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasigaye bahungira mu gisagara c’i Afeka; maz’ uruzitiro rwaho rw’amabuye rusidukira ku bantu ibihumbi mirongwibiri n’indwi mur’ abo bari basigaye. Beni‐hadadi na we arahunga, yitera mu nzu yo mur’ ico gisagara, arenga hirya mu mpete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abamenyekana biwe baramubarira, bati Twumvise kw abami b’Abisirayeli ar’ abami b’ abanyakigongwe; enda rero ni dukenyere amagunira, twīte ibiyonzoyonzo mw izosi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Giheburayo handitswe ngo Mu mitwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " dusokoroke tuje ku mwami w’Abisirayeli; kumbure yoguhangaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bakenyera amagunira, bīta ibiyonzoyonzo mw izosi, baja ku mwami w’Abisirayeli, baramubarira, bat’ Umusavyi wawe Beni‐hadadi ngo Mutabare umuhangaze. Arababaza, ati Mbeg’ aracariho? Na kare yari mugenzanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abo bagabo bari bareretse iryomuvamwo, baca bamuzigira kur’ iryo jambo, bat’ Eka Beni‐hadadi yari mugenzawe koko. Na we ati Ni mugende mumuzane. Nuko Beni‐hadadi arasokoroka, aza iy’ ari; Ahabu amwūriza mu mukogote wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Beni‐hadadi aramubarira, at’ Ibisagara data yanyaze so nzobigusubiza; kand’ uzogira aho kudandariza i Damasiko, nk’uko data yar’ ahafise i Samariya. Ahabu aramwishura, ati Ndemeye iryo sezerano: ndakurekuye. Nuko barasezerana, aramurekura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
